w: Res-cue the per-ish-ing, | Care for the dy-ing, | Snatch them in pit-y from | sin and the grave; | Weep o'er the err-ing one, | Lift up the fall-en, | Tell them of Je-sus the | Might-y to save. | Res-cue the per-ish-ing, | care for the dy-ing; | Je-sus is mer-ci-ful, | Je-sus will save.
